11) Notwithstanding anything contained herein, the Lessor shall bear no liability for any loss or damage to the Lessee’s goods, chattels, or personal effects within the demised premises, whether caused by fire, flood, theft, burglary, riot, act of God, or any other cause whatsoever, and the Lessee agrees to indemnify and hold the Lessor harmless against any claims in this regard.
12) The Lessee has the right and shall be allowed to display name board/sign board or the like at the front or outer elevation of the Demised Premises to the extent rented by Lessor.
13) Common toilet facility is provided & maintenance of toilets will be borne by Lessee, shared among other tenants.
14) The Lessee shall neither carry nor stock any explosive materials alcohol or forbidden materials inside the demised premises and shall not carry out any activity in the demised building which is prohibited by Law of the Land.
15) That any dispute or discrepancies arising out of this agreement shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the courts at Bhimavaram, West Godavari Dist, A.P
