19) The Lessor shall have a right to sell, assign or encumber the land during the subsistence of the rent period; and The Lessor shall have full right and authority to deal with the rest of the property in any manner.
20) The Lessee shall keep and maintain the Demised Premises in good, proper, and tenable condition at his own cost all the time during the rent period without causing any nuisance and disturbance to the neighbors.
21) The Lessor shall not be responsible for electricity receipt or payment of bills or disconnection in case of default of payment.
